---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ComingSoon from '../components/ComingSoon.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Built for AI agents"
  description="Primate Vision is the first video understanding API an AI agent can integrate end-to-end with zero human touch. Mint a sandbox key, discover the API via llms.txt, run an analysis, return results."
  canonicalPath="/agents"
  mdTwin="/agents-page.md"
>
  <div class="page">
    <section class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">For AI agents</p>
      <h1>Built for AI agents</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Zero human touch from discovery to first result.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="content">
      <p>
        Primate Vision is the first video understanding API an AI agent can integrate
        end-to-end with zero human touch: the agent mints its own sandbox key
        (<code>POST /v1/sandbox</code> — no signup, no card), discovers the API via
        machine-readable surfaces, runs an analysis, and returns results to the user.
        A human only enters the loop when money is owed.
      </p>

      <h2>Get a key — no email, no card</h2>
      <pre><code>curl -X POST https://api.primateintelligence.ai/v1/sandbox</code></pre>
      <p>
        Returns a <code>pv_test_*</code> key instantly. The key is good for a metered
        free grant — enough to run real analyses. No signup flow, no OAuth redirect,
        no human waiting at the other end.
      </p>

      <h2>Discovery surfaces</h2>
      <ul class="surfaces">
        <li>
          <a href="/llms.txt"><code>/llms.txt</code></a> — agent-readable index of the entire API
          and every product page, in plain text
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/llms-full.txt"><code>/llms-full.txt</code></a> — full docs corpus in one file
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/agents.md"><code>/agents.md</code></a> — agent quickstart guide with copy-paste
          curl commands
        </li>
        <li>
          Markdown twins of every page — append <code>.md</code> to any URL
          (e.g. <code>/pricing.md</code>, <code>/compare/twelve-labs.md</code>)
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://smithery.ai/servers/matt-uwba/primate-intelligence">MCP server on Smithery</a>
          — drop into any MCP-capable agent with <code>npx @primate-intelligence/mcp</code>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Full API docs</h2>
      <p>
        <a href="/docs">Read the docs →</a> · OpenAPI 3.1 contract at
        <code>https://api.primateintelligence.ai/v1/openapi.json</code>
      </p>

      <ComingSoon note="The full 'Let Claude analyze your video' walkthrough — coming during our August launch." />
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .page { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 128px 24px 192px; }
  .hero { margin-bottom: 80px; }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--fs-footnote);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-signal);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  h1 { font-size: var(--fs-h1); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .lede { font-size: var(--fs-body-lg); color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }
  .content p { font-size: var(--fs-body-lg); line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-text-primary); opacity: 0.85; margin: 0 0 32px; }
  .content a { color: var(--color-signal); }
  .content a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  h2 { font-size: var(--fs-h4); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin: 80px 0 24px; }
  pre {
    background: #1a1916;
    color: #e6e9f4;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-size: var(--fs-subhead);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  pre code { background: none; padding: 0; color: inherit; }
  code {
    background: var(--color-bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 1px 6px;
    font-size: var(--fs-subhead);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }
  pre code { background: none; border: none; padding: 0; font-size: inherit; }

  .surfaces {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .surfaces li {
    padding: 14px 16px;
    background: var(--color-bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) { h1 { font-size: var(--fs-h2); } .page { padding: 88px 20px 128px; } }
</style>
